              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " tetere kiticat ikusitauon koraas Iuemamei aitoronet kotoma alaunit kakonyen nuka Edeke Papawok, naebunio Ejakaitiwok Yesu nepepe kalukalaunakake kere.",
          "type": "text",
